          "text": "Focused physical examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Neurological examination grossly normal. Abdomen soft and non-tender with no masses. No goitre or tremor. Remainder of examination unremarkable."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-24",
