        "valueString": "Denies fever, night sweats, significant unintentional weight loss beyond mild reduced intake on work days, chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, heat or cold intolerance, tremor, bowel habit change beyond work-related loose stools, and menstrual issues volunteered today."
